WEBVTT

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:08.060
Huh?

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.750
Mahjong is a popular Chinese table game.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.750
[Mahjong technical language]

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.660
Shit, that isn't cheating, is it?

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:32.130
After all, Hawaii is the best.
No matter what they say.

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:48.930
<i>Well, when the sign goes out, we begin.</i>

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.730
<i>This is the last scene.</i>

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.060
I'm home!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.200
Eh? Welcome home.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.600
Sorry for the intrusion.

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:01.460
Huh?!

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:05.800
Wh-What's with this room?

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:13.400
Sorry, we haven't slept for three days.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:16.000
We'll properly clean it up later.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.260
All night Mahjong? You...

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:19.600
Continue! Continue!

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:21.530
You're still high school students!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:22.660
Everyone, leave now!

00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:26.530
Shut up, now is not the time for that.

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:28.800
LEAVE!!

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:32.660
If you're going to do it, do it tomorrow.

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.330
Sorry...

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:35.930
See ya tomorrow!

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.600
Sorry for bothering!

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:41.660
It's already tomorrow!

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:43.930
Oh! Good for you to come. Come in, come in!

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.000
Didn't I say to leave?!

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:48.930
But, it's already tomorrow!

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.400
I said leave! Want me to kill you?!

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:52.460
Run!

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:53.460
Seriously...

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.860
Okusan...

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.860
Okusan - wife, married woman.

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:01.200
Already back from your overseas vacation?

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:03.200
Y-Yeah...

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.460
Those runners are your son's friends?

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:10.930
They smoke in front of the elevator
and put motorcycles at the entrance...

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.660
To make matters worse...

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:12.600
This is bad.

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.460
She's really angry.

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:17.660
The other day they even stole my underwear.

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:18.600
Huh?!

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:23.530
<i>I thought it was her daughter's panties!</i>

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:29.130
A-Anyway, I can't just standby idly and say nothing!

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:32.060
I'm sorry...

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:42.260
SHONAN JUNAI GUMI!

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:42.260
5

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:42.260
LAST SIGNAL

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:49.130
Are you okay after yesterday?

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:50.600
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:53.600
Makoto and Kazeyuki will arrive soon.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:54.530
But...

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:57.860
To think that those panties
belonged to the hag next door...

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:02.530
Huh?

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.600
Why is my bag...?

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:05.530
Huh?

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:08.150
To Miss Onizuka

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:08.150
For more details, please visit the
building itself. The door will be open

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:08.150
You're living here,
starting today! - Mom

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:08.150
Building name:
Château de Riverside
Room #505

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:14.260
Château de Riverside, Room #505.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:15.930
Eh? That's how it is?

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:17.200
I'll do it!

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.330
That hag... don't you think
everything will be as you want!

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.930
Even if you beg, I won't come back, damn it!

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.130
Seriously... that annoying hag.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.730
Kicking out a high school student.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.000
But...

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:39.660
If you try and think about it, you
might see serious parental care.

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:40.800
Ryuuji.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:42.660
What do you think about the rest?

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.400
Château de Riverside...

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:47.460
It's not a bad name, huh?

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:50.400
Imagine how many cute girls are there.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:55.860
Hey! Hey!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.130
Is it really this way?

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:59.730
Yeah, the map shows this way.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.860
It isn't in this dump, right?

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:05.060
Is it somewhere around here?

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:07.060
Here!

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:08.460
It's here without a doubt!

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:09.130
Eh?

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:10.930
Aaah! That?

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.660
That old hag isn't so bad after all!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:14.530
It's pretty good!

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.930
It feels like it's really a château.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:17.800
Yahoo!

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:44.860
Pretty, pretty girl!

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.060
Huh?

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.260
Château de Riverside

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:50.330
O-Old hag!

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:55.330
How is this dump, Château de Riverside?

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:01.860
Ryuuji...

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:02.930
I'm going home.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.130
Well, it can't be that bad...

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:07.600
It's not good!

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.660
How can I live in this dirty place?

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.400
There's no key, no bathroom, and
instead of a toilet there is a pot!

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:16.130
Wait, she was coming this way, wasn't she?

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.200
And she was a beauty too.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:20.730
Red dress and red high heels!

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:24.330
And you could also unveil it.

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:26.400
Huh?

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.460
You just have to get used to it, after all.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:32.260
What's wrong, Ryuuji?!

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.260
It hurts! The lights!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.860
Quick, turn on the lights!

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:38.800
T-The tatami is rotten!

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:40.200
Wh-What?

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:42.130
There's a stain on the wall.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:43.660
Is that a man?

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:47.530
Looks tasty!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.330
They are poisonous!

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:56.000
After cleaning it, it doesn't seem so bad.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.800
It won't get any sunlight from north, though.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.930
Seems like the wind is still
blowing from somewhere.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.200
This is definitely not good.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:05.260
Without a doubt.

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:06.200
It's a man.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:07.930
There's nothing here.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:10.330
If it bothers you, just clean it up.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.730
I cleaned it and cleaned it, and it's still visible!

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:13.860
That stain.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.530
Like a demon crying from the back.

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.530
Didn't you just hear something?

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:22.600
Yeah...

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:34.000
They're doing it...

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:37.130
Hey! Can't you do something so we can see it?

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:41.000
Here, this spot in the head.

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:43.400
Well, how is it?

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:44.260
Can you see it?

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:46.330
Yeah, I see...

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.260
It's a woman...

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.530
Blonde?

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:51.530
What color?

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:53.200
W-Wait, just a little bit.

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.200
She's not alone.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:57.400
Oh! Amazing!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.460
Hey! Let me see, Ryuuji!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.460
I'm next!

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.260
Shut up!

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:03.730
This is my room!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:04.530
What?

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:09.260
I just saw a bit...

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.330
Could it be we were caught?

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:13.530
It's because you screamed, you idiot!

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:16.130
W-Why is it my fault?!

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:16.730
Huh?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.200
I-I got it!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.060
I figured out the secret of this stain.

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:23.660
Huh?

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.130
The previous guest was peeping.

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:28.000
That's why there is this stain.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.000
I see!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.750
That means... this room...

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:32.730
Yeah!

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:35.600
Peeping Paradise!!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:39.400
Huh?

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.700
Red high heels!

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.330
And a red dress!

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:53.660
It's the woman from yesterday.

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:55.730
And what a slut!

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.330
Sexy...

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.200
Isn't she hot?

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:08.330
She's coming back!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.130
Good evening.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:19.060
G-Good evening...

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.260
Somehow, we made it...

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:27.300
Night Vision Device - Russia

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:29.060
125,000 yen, huh?

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.530
This is a little expensive.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.060
Yeah. Are you going to use it for lustful purposes?

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.530
It works perfectly at night in the park!

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:38.400
Huh? In the park at night?

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:39.060
Here...

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:42.730
You can attach it to your
head, leaving both hands free!

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:43.930
In other words...

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:45.660
You can do it as long as you want!

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:47.260
As long as we want?

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:48.460
You...

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:50.130
are going to peep after all, right?

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:51.930
Peep?

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:53.660
Of course not!

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:55.660
We're going bird watching, right?

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.130
R-Right...!

00:08:57.530 --> 00:09:00.060
Watching out for little birds!

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:03.060
125,000 yen...

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.860
After all, we can't do anything but to give up.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:08.530
That naked girl...

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:09.800
Eh?!

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:11.530
Ah! Kazeyuki!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.860
What are you doing in such a place?

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:15.460
Not much...

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:16.400
Huh?

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:26.260
Could it be, Eikichi-san, that
you were about to go peep?

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:27.860
Kazeyuki...

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:29.460
I'm sad...

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:33.460
To be seen by you in such a way.

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:34.930
The fact is...

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:37.130
I came here to buy a night scope.

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:39.530
But it was too expensive.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:40.930
Night scope?

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:43.800
You can see in the dark with it.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.730
You understand? In the dark.

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:48.330
I could use a few fights in the dark.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:52.000
I see! Onibaku's going to have to fight in the dark!

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:53.330
It was recently...

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:55.200
I was going to a convenience store.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:58.800
And I was attacked by them in absolute darkness.

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:03.330
In a place without any light, they
seemed to see my movements.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:07.930
Relying on smell and hearing,
I could fight somehow.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:11.660
At that time, they were wearing a night scope.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:17.330
That's why...

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:19.660
If you want to fight in the dark...

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.400
You must somehow have a night scope, but...

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.530
It costs 125,000 yen.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.660
Ramen

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:30.460
Kazeyuki really fell for it!

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:33.060
What was all that for?

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:34.330
What?

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:38.060
If I had destroyed the image of the
Onibaku that's on is mind, I'd feel bad for it.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:39.330
Eikichi-san!

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:39.930
Huh?

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:41.930
Huh?!

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:43.600
Kazeyuki!

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.200
I got my hands on it.

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:48.400
A Russian night scope...

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:49.930
Where did you get them?

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:51.400
And two of them!

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:53.200
We stole them.

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:54.530
From that store.

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:56.800
This is what we got for taking these...

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.000
You... stole them?

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.400
With them you can make it, right?

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.260
Those night fighters...

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:06.530
We're just in bad terms with them.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.460
If you lend us the power of Onibaku...

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:09.660
we will definitely win.

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:11.330
Well, shall we go?

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:13.860
I know where they hang out.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:16.600
We'll definitely destroy them, right?

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:27.260
Hey!

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:28.800
What?

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:30.330
Do you have any business with me?

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.530
We've come to destroy you bastards!

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.060
Destroy?

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:37.800
Hey, you two...

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:39.530
Those are weird scopes you're wearing...

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.930
Haven't you mistaken this for peeping, huh?

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:46.400
Hey, Eikichi...

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:47.400
What should we do?

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.130
Now that you ask me...

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:52.260
This is because you told all sorts of nonsense.

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:54.660
Are you picking up a fight with us?

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:58.180
Ah! It has begun!

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:59.600
Hey! Stop it, you guys!

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:03.600
Eikichi-san!

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:04.400
Ryuuji-san!

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.330
What are you staring at?

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:18.800
How dare you do this to my night scope...

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:21.460
This costs 125,000 yen!

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:23.060
You assholes!

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:26.400
I will teach you!

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:39.690
Juvenile Dpt.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.260
It seems it was terrible, huh?

00:12:40.060 --> 00:12:43.260
The other guys already ran away.

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.400
Is this so important?

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:47.260
You...

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:49.330
Peeping criminals, huh?

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:51.200
Detective...

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.000
Hmm?

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:54.260
Lend me a screwdriver.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:57.400
If I don't hurry up and fix this, it'll be too late.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.130
Shut the hell up, you bastard!

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:00.800
Write!

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.060
The names of your friends.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:05.400
HEY!!

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:07.260
I said write!

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:17.300
FORMAL APOLOGY
At approximately 2:00 AM on the Xth day of the month of O, I caused a fight to occur in front of the convenience store on Hirazuka 15th Street.
I hereby apologize for causing damage to the store,
and swear to never again cause an incident such as this one.

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:17.300
O/X
Enoshima Commercial
High School, Senior
Kunito Nakajo

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:23.600
Hey, are you okay with this?

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:25.930
Using Nakajo's name...

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:29.460
Even you used old man's Tamura name.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.860
Don't worry.

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:34.330
For the fingerprints I used
blood, so there's no evidence.

00:13:35.400 --> 00:13:37.400
But if Nakajo finds out, then...

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:41.330
it'll be an all out war with Tsuji High!

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:42.800
That is what I want.

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.330
Sooner or later it had to happen.

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.800
We'll keep quiet about it until we crush them!

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:49.690
Tsujidou Prefecture Senior High School

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.060
Really...

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:55.860
Long time no see, Mariko.

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:57.000
I was surprised.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:59.000
That you, Kadena-san, were back to teaching.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:00.660
Everything has changed...

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:02.060
here in Tsuji.

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:05.260
Back then, it had more of a salty fragrance.

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:12.600
It's a thong, hey!

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:14.130
And it's red!

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:18.860
Ryuuji!

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:20.000
That is...

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.800
The red high hells woman!

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:24.400
W-Why is she here?

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:27.600
Let me introduce you to the new teacher.

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.260
Lucky! Just as I thought!

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:36.000
From today on, I'll be in charge of this class.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:36.860
My name is Kadena Nao.

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:40.130
From now on, we'll be seeing each other often.

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:41.000
Nice to meet you.

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:44.530
Sensei...

