Only after I beat you!

00:28:54.740 --> 00:28:55.730
I'll kill you, you bastard!

00:28:57.060 --> 00:28:57.590
Huh?

00:29:01.730 --> 00:29:02.400
What's wrong?

00:29:02.500 --> 00:29:03.380
Aren't you coming?

00:29:04.340 --> 00:29:06.080
W-W-What are you doing?

00:29:06.180 --> 00:29:07.520
That's dangerous!

00:29:07.620 --> 00:29:09.610
Isn't it obvious? I'm jumping.

00:29:09.710 --> 00:29:10.380
Jumping?

00:29:10.580 --> 00:29:12.580
Aren't you all men?

00:29:13.200 --> 00:29:15.600
You don't even have the guts to jump from here...

00:29:15.700 --> 00:29:17.060
and you already want to have sex with me.

00:29:17.750 --> 00:29:19.750
Life's not that easy!

00:29:19.950 --> 00:29:21.510
Who would jump?!

00:29:21.610 --> 00:29:22.630
You would die!

00:29:22.730 --> 00:29:25.170
You are a teacher, so you should know!

00:29:25.270 --> 00:29:28.880
If you jump from here, the
water will be like concrete!

00:29:29.080 --> 00:29:31.200
You'd be smashed like a block of tofu!

00:29:45.520 --> 00:29:45.970
S-She jumped!

00:29:46.170 --> 00:29:48.690
That woman jumped!

00:29:48.790 --> 00:29:50.620
I-Is she alive?

00:29:50.720 --> 00:29:52.830
From this height...

00:29:52.930 --> 00:29:53.780
she died!

00:29:53.880 --> 00:29:55.270
What a pity...!

00:30:01.240 --> 00:30:02.180
Hurry up and get down here!

00:30:02.280 --> 00:30:04.560
I'm already soaking wet!

00:30:04.950 --> 00:30:08.740
<i>This woman has guts...</i>

00:30:23.920 --> 00:30:28.070
After the previous test, this
class as overtaken class C.

00:30:28.170 --> 00:30:30.520
Finally becoming the
number three class in school!

00:30:33.600 --> 00:30:36.540
If you make a little more effort,
first place won't be dream.

00:30:36.640 --> 00:30:37.810
Hey, have you heard?

00:30:37.910 --> 00:30:41.490
That teacher made a dangerous
deal with the students!

00:30:41.690 --> 00:30:45.750
To make the test scores better, she
gives them a special treatment.

00:31:01.150 --> 00:31:01.840
Huh...

00:31:02.360 --> 00:31:03.770
Is this the teacher's car?

00:31:05.160 --> 00:31:08.290
Murasaki L28 Turbo.

00:31:08.390 --> 00:31:10.810
This isn't a car for women...

00:31:13.700 --> 00:31:14.880
Hmm... a Zephyr, right?

00:31:15.510 --> 00:31:17.740
Not a bad bike you have here.

00:31:17.940 --> 00:31:20.050
Are you interested in such thing?

00:31:21.310 --> 00:31:22.170
Hey...

00:31:22.270 --> 00:31:24.520
That tattoo isn't just for show, right?

00:31:34.270 --> 00:31:36.510
That's not how a woman should drive.

00:31:36.610 --> 00:31:38.330
<i>Diving from Bay Bridge...</i>

00:31:38.430 --> 00:31:40.020
<i>A tattoo of Maria...</i>

00:31:40.120 --> 00:31:43.610
<i>and a L28 Murasaki Turbo.</i>

00:31:44.120 --> 00:31:45.700
<i>Who is this woman?</i>

00:31:54.400 --> 00:31:55.330
Hello, Nao-chan.

00:31:55.520 --> 00:31:56.950
You're beautiful as always!

00:31:57.460 --> 00:31:58.180
Huh?

00:31:58.680 --> 00:31:59.490
Hello!

00:32:00.250 --> 00:32:04.690
Sorry, but tell Mom that I have some
business today. I'll be away from the shop.

00:32:04.790 --> 00:32:05.560
Okay, I understand.

00:32:05.700 --> 00:32:06.550
I'll tell her.

00:32:08.550 --> 00:32:10.540
As always, good driving.

00:32:12.100 --> 00:32:15.520
<i>It can't be that this teacher has such a night life.</i>

00:32:15.990 --> 00:32:18.520
<i>She has a hostess job at a nightclub?</i>

00:32:18.620 --> 00:32:21.050
<i>I'm becoming more and more
interested in that woman!</i>

00:32:39.030 --> 00:32:40.350
What's wrong, Ryuuji?

00:32:40.450 --> 00:32:42.200
T-This thing!

00:32:42.700 --> 00:32:43.570
Idiot!

00:32:43.770 --> 00:32:45.320
This isn't what we're looking for!

00:32:45.500 --> 00:32:46.960
Get serious!

00:32:47.140 --> 00:32:47.890
B-But...

00:32:48.350 --> 00:32:50.810
even if there are such things?

00:32:51.600 --> 00:32:52.450
Where?

00:32:52.670 --> 00:32:53.600
Here!

00:32:54.150 --> 00:32:54.840
Incredible!

00:32:54.990 --> 00:32:56.350
Has she been wearing these?

00:32:56.980 --> 00:32:59.250
I-Is there something else?

00:33:08.250 --> 00:33:09.580
<i>Who's this guy?</i>

00:33:10.350 --> 00:33:11.270
Eikichi!

00:33:11.740 --> 00:33:13.150
What is it this time?

00:33:13.310 --> 00:33:14.340
T-This!

00:33:16.640 --> 00:33:17.760
What is this?!

00:33:17.940 --> 00:33:19.190
All in 1,000 yen bills.

00:33:19.340 --> 00:33:20.230
How much is in here?

00:33:20.380 --> 00:33:21.610
I don't know, but...

00:33:21.800 --> 00:33:22.940
there are also 2,000's.

00:33:23.300 --> 00:33:24.020
This is bad!

00:33:24.210 --> 00:33:26.230
That woman is really dangerous!

00:33:27.940 --> 00:33:29.790
Quickly! Let's run!

00:33:30.070 --> 00:33:31.870
Wait! That way is no good!

00:33:32.800 --> 00:33:33.750
Eikichi!

00:33:39.710 --> 00:33:40.490
Come in.

00:33:40.690 --> 00:33:42.750
We can have a peaceful conversation in here.

00:33:49.110 --> 00:33:50.450
Well, let's begin.

00:33:50.860 --> 00:33:51.850
Let's talk about business.

00:33:51.950 --> 00:33:53.540
30,000,000 yen...

00:33:53.710 --> 00:33:55.860
that was the promise, remember?

00:34:01.120 --> 00:34:02.060
There are 30,000,000 yen here.

00:34:02.570 --> 00:34:03.580
That thing...

00:34:04.070 --> 00:34:05.490
will you sell it now?

00:34:05.910 --> 00:34:06.850
<i>Thing?</i>

00:34:07.720 --> 00:34:10.130
Oh! It's a good thing you collected this much.

00:34:12.010 --> 00:34:12.930
Our deal.

00:34:13.140 --> 00:34:14.470
Now, let's not rush things.

00:34:14.950 --> 00:34:18.010
After all, there's legal stuff to discuss.

00:34:21.510 --> 00:34:24.640
In fact, couldn't you do something
else to add another 100,000 yen?

00:34:25.040 --> 00:34:25.810
You!

00:34:26.060 --> 00:34:27.700
"Are you going to look at my feet?"

00:34:27.990 --> 00:34:29.230
That's how things are.

00:34:29.430 --> 00:34:33.090
After all, it'll be bad if rumors begin to spread.

00:34:34.100 --> 00:34:35.150
I got it...

00:34:36.030 --> 00:34:37.250
Then leave!

00:34:37.350 --> 00:34:38.490
A-A gun?!

00:34:38.690 --> 00:34:40.460
<i>What? A gun?</i>

00:34:41.050 --> 00:34:44.740
If you don't get out of my
sight quickly, I'll kill you!

00:34:50.000 --> 00:34:50.980
Get out.

00:34:57.600 --> 00:35:00.300
Mariko!!

00:35:02.260 --> 00:35:04.980
Hey! What are you doing, you pervert?!

00:35:05.080 --> 00:35:06.890
She's going to kill Eikichi! Eikichi!

00:35:07.090 --> 00:35:09.640
She has a gun pointed at him!

00:35:10.040 --> 00:35:10.580
Eh?

00:35:14.620 --> 00:35:15.280
You bastard...

00:35:15.590 --> 00:35:17.570
did you hear our conversation?

00:35:17.770 --> 00:35:19.230
W-What conversation?

00:35:19.390 --> 00:35:22.330
I haven't heard anything, I haven't seen anything...

00:35:23.740 --> 00:35:26.360
You'll regret it in another world.

00:35:32.990 --> 00:35:34.290
It's hot!

00:35:34.790 --> 00:35:36.620
Well, did I scared you?

00:35:37.460 --> 00:35:38.380
A lighter?

00:35:38.650 --> 00:35:39.430
That gun?

00:35:39.710 --> 00:35:42.540
Some time ago, it helped a lot against some guys.

00:35:43.350 --> 00:35:46.070
Kadena-san is well know around these parts.

00:35:46.370 --> 00:35:48.070
Really, it was a long time ago!

00:35:48.170 --> 00:35:50.020
It was incredible.

00:35:50.120 --> 00:35:50.970
Hey...

00:35:51.070 --> 00:35:54.050
Really, who is she?

00:35:55.180 --> 00:35:57.320
Someone who's admired, I suppose...

00:35:57.680 --> 00:35:59.060
Admired?

00:35:59.250 --> 00:35:59.760
Yes!

00:35:59.760 --> 00:36:02.750
Everyone drives furiously in Shonan...

00:36:02.850 --> 00:36:05.800
for those who they admire.

00:36:11.460 --> 00:36:14.870
Hey, do you want to battle me?

00:36:16.620 --> 00:36:17.770
With that Murasaki?

00:36:17.870 --> 00:36:18.850
That's right.

00:36:19.890 --> 00:36:24.560
After I saw you, I remembered the old days.

00:36:26.770 --> 00:36:29.220
I was just a little brat at that time.

00:36:30.620 --> 00:36:31.850
Surrounded by cars and bikes.

00:36:32.150 --> 00:36:34.820
How many kilometers have I drove?

00:36:34.920 --> 00:36:36.470
I was just an idiot.

00:36:38.860 --> 00:36:41.810
Someone told them to drive aggressively.

00:36:42.010 --> 00:36:44.120
To cut corners.

00:36:44.320 --> 00:36:46.210
Such a dangerous race!

00:36:47.790 --> 00:36:50.600
"Last Signal" is that kind of race.

00:37:02.550 --> 00:37:06.160
Got it? When the sign goes out, we begin.

00:37:07.050 --> 00:37:08.600
The Last Signal.

00:37:09.350 --> 00:37:10.680
Last Signal?

00:37:10.690 --> 00:37:12.500
What do you mean?

00:37:17.130 --> 00:37:19.060
So, that's what you mean?

00:37:19.160 --> 00:37:21.080
Stop kidding me!

00:37:22.170 --> 00:37:23.810
Don't underestimate the Zephyr!

00:37:31.440 --> 00:37:32.570
Hey! Hey! What will you do?

00:37:32.670 --> 00:37:34.440
The sign is red!

00:37:34.540 --> 00:37:36.360
Have you admitted defeat? Hey!

00:37:59.580 --> 00:38:01.430
Bastard! You wanna die?!

00:38:02.740 --> 00:38:04.740
I see, so that's how it is!

00:38:04.840 --> 00:38:06.480
Isn't this interesting?

00:38:08.940 --> 00:38:11.750
Knowledge, concentration, mind...

00:38:11.850 --> 00:38:17.560
If you can't control them all, it's a deadly race.

00:38:18.120 --> 00:38:19.890
That day, on a Last Signal race...

00:38:19.990 --> 00:38:22.190
he was a living legend.

00:38:23.370 --> 00:38:25.280
Until that accident.

00:38:27.070 --> 00:38:28.820
Accident?

00:38:29.000 --> 00:38:30.960
Her younger brother almost died...

00:38:30.960 --> 00:38:32.610
in that accident...

00:38:45.610 --> 00:38:46.910
We're almost at Daikan Mountain.

00:38:47.050 --> 00:38:48.020
What do you think?

00:38:48.180 --> 00:38:49.370
I'll overtake you!

00:39:07.230 --> 00:39:08.420
My skills have surely weakened.

00:39:09.440 --> 00:39:12.410
After all, when you go deep,
death becomes frightening.

00:39:13.090 --> 00:39:14.760
Go deep?

00:39:16.420 --> 00:39:19.590
Somehow, Onizuka-kun, you have
the same scent as Kazuhito.

00:39:20.630 --> 00:39:23.890
I'll show you now the cross that I bear.

00:39:28.930 --> 00:39:32.670
This is my younger brother Kazuhito.
He's been sleeping for four years now...

00:39:32.870 --> 00:39:34.070
Four years?

00:39:34.320 --> 00:39:35.300
Why?

00:39:35.470 --> 00:39:37.470
It was because of a Last Signal race.

00:39:37.570 --> 00:39:39.130
I was challenged.

00:39:39.230 --> 00:39:41.610
Kazuhito hated to lose.

00:39:42.400 --> 00:39:45.420
He always said to quit racing.

00:39:46.240 --> 00:39:48.600
But I did not listen to him.

00:39:48.700 --> 00:39:50.680
Because he was just a high school student.

00:39:50.780 --> 00:39:53.730
I didn't know it was so important to him.

00:39:53.830 --> 00:39:56.530
That boy seriously wanted to race against me.

00:40:04.650 --> 00:40:05.790
<i>Sister...</i>

00:40:05.890 --> 00:40:06.880
<i>Kazuhito!</i>

00:40:07.550 --> 00:40:10.130
<i>As I expected, you're amazing...</i>

00:40:10.610 --> 00:40:12.040
<i>Sister.</i>

00:40:13.540 --> 00:40:15.610
For something stupid...

00:40:16.730 --> 00:40:18.810
my younger brother ended up like this.

00:40:19.700 --> 00:40:24.450
The guys who came to my house earlier,
were the coordinators of Yami Hospital.

00:40:25.320 --> 00:40:30.290
This system that supports
his life needs to be replaced.

00:41:02.510 --> 00:41:04.360
<i>Kyosuke's Z2!</i>

00:41:08.480 --> 00:41:10.450
Hey, I came for you!

00:41:10.550 --> 00:41:11.560
Let's do it!

00:41:11.660 --> 00:41:12.870
What we began yesterday!

00:41:13.050 --> 00:41:15.340
We haven't settled it yet, right?

00:41:18.390 --> 00:41:23.930
If I don't win with this, you'll be in a bad mood again!
